  "value": {
   "reference": "simulate the greedy literally: per assignment, scan every human and every model for the least loaded one not yet on the current task",
   "candidate_design": "the greedy is round robin: assignment number q (counting from 0 over the whole schedule) gets human q mod totalHuman and model q mod totalModel, so each triple is written directly",
